    // functional unit, exactly one single-cycle pulse per instruction:
    //   * integer ALU  : IQ -> ALU accept  (issue_valid && issue_ready)
    //   * load / store : rename -> LSU accept (lsu_disp_valid && lsu_disp_ready)
    // Memory instructions never enter the integer issue queue in this
